# ML experiments

- Inside `mlflow.start_run()`, log params, validation metrics (log loss, Brier, accuracy, AUC), and the git SHA (`git_commit` tag).
- Model selection uses validation only. Do not read test (2025) metrics to pick a model.
- Compare every candidate to the configured reference. Phase 1's default reference is the home-prior baseline (`baseline-home`: constant probability equal to the training home win rate). Phase 2 H1 and H2 compare to logistic feature set `current`. Phase 2 H3 compares to logistic feature set `h2_full`.
- Phase 1 (`python -m src.train.train --cv`) is rolling-origin CV on seasons 2016-2023. 2024 stays the final validation. 2025 is not scored. The paired comparison is log loss against the home prior.
- Phase 2 H1 (`python -m src.train.train --cv --phase 2 --hypothesis h1`) uses the same window and scores logistic `current`, `diff`, and `diff_only`, plus the home prior, Elo, and the market. Tags are `phase=2` and `hypothesis=h1-diff`. The report is `reports/phase2/`.
- Phase 2 H2 uses the same window and scores logistic `current`, `h2_def`, and `h2_full`, plus the same baselines, against logistic `current`. Tags are `phase=2` and `hypothesis=h2-season-def-regression`. The report is `reports/phase2_h2/`.
- Phase 2 H3 (`make train-cv`) uses the same window and scores logistic `h2_full`, `h3_split`, and `h3_replace`, plus the same baselines, against logistic `h2_full`. Tags are `phase=2` and `hypothesis=h3-pass-rush-epa`. The report is `reports/phase2_h3/`.
- Accept a phase 2 set only when pooled log loss improves by at least 0.003 and the 95% interval lies entirely below 0.
- Log sklearn models with the reviewed skops trusted-types allowlist only (`REVIEWED_SKOPS_TRUSTED_TYPES`). An unknown type fails closed.
